  /// generated with the pre-gh-1226 doubling rule — an entry named
  /// `z.ai` on host `api.z.ai` persisted `FA_KEY_API_Z_AI_Z_AI` where the
  /// canonical slot is `FA_KEY_API_Z_AI` (gh-1226 AC3). Resolution still
